# Frontend environment configuration.
# Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and adjust as needed. All Vite-exposed vars must
# be prefixed with VITE_.

# Base URL for the MaintainIQ API. Leave unset in dev (the Vite proxy forwards
# /api -> http://localhost:8000) and in prod (FastAPI serves this SPA from the
# same origin). Override only when the API lives on a different host.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000/api

# MQTT broker settings (live ingest, M6) are backend-only — never put secrets
# in the browser bundle. They live in the repository root `.env.example` as
# MQTT_BROKER_HOST, MQTT_BROKER_PORT, MQTT_USERNAME, MQTT_PASSWORD, MQTT_TLS,
# MQTT_CA_CERT, MQTT_CLIENT_ID and MQTT_TOPIC_PREFIX (see README.md).
